  "response_text": "To use the same stack allocation method to make a number, n, new stacks, we would do the following. After defining our main stack size using MSP_init_val \u2013 MAIN_STACK_SIZE, the address of STACK_N would be defined as STACK_N = MSP_init_val - MAIN_STACK_SIZE \u2013 (n-1) * THREAD_STACK_SIZE if all threads were the same size. If the threads were not all the same size, the address of STACK_N would be defined as STACK_N = STACK_(N-1) \u2013 STACK_SIZE(N-1) where stack 0 is the main stack.\\n",
